  "semanticCorrections": [
    "UI runtime frame ordering declares Input only; old prose also claimed a Text dependency.",
    "Neutral .iuidocument import requires language/implementation settings; .rml belongs to the RmlUi authoring adapter.",
    "Controlled linked RCSS and recursive imports are supported; they do not grant arbitrary filesystem/network access.",
    "UiInputSnapshot is a Runtime script export; UiTextureUpdate is the current texture delta type.",
    "Setter success means an existing target and applied operation, not a value difference.",
    "RmlUi event draining clears in finally even when copying fails; frame acknowledgment has a separate success boundary.",
    "Font lease sharing requires the full registration identity, including document version and family.",
    "Failed RmlUi disposal is not retried by the same disposed instance."
  ],
